# Lively Dirge, modes 1 and 2 (spree, CR 702.172; modes are followed in printed order, CR 700.2): Bot1 puts a Guerrilla
# Gorilla into its graveyard with Entomb on turn 1. On turn 3 it casts Lively Dirge for {1}{B} + {1} + {2} = 5 mana
# (Mox Jet, Mox Pearl, Mox Ruby and two Swamps). Mode 1 searches for the second Gorilla and puts it into the graveyard; mode 2
# then returns both Gorillas, chosen together (mana values 2 + 2 = 4, the most allowed), to the battlefield together. The Dirge goes to the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Entomb
Lively Dirge
Guerrilla Gorilla
Guerrilla Gorilla
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Guerrilla Gorilla)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Lively Dirge.Cast
Bot1.Modes(1; 2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Search(Guerrilla Gorilla)
Bot1.Choose(Guerrilla Gorilla; Guerrilla Gorilla)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Lively Dirge; Entomb
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Swamp; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby; Guerrilla Gorilla; Guerrilla Gorilla
